{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":160,"count":33,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L09-1-08\",\"聪明\",\"聰明\",\"聪明\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我們可以去問家樂，他非常聰明，我想他懂。","pinyin":"Wǒmen kěyǐ qù wèn Jiālè, tā fēicháng cōngmíng, wǒ xiǎng tā dǒng.","english":"We can ask Jiale; he is very smart. I think he understands it.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-1-01","sourceFront":"句子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L09-3-05\",\"练习\",\"練習\",\"练习\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"下個星期華語課有期中考，我有一點兒緊張，所以每天晚上都讀書，也練習寫字，希望下個星期的考試能考得很好。","pinyin":"Xià ge xīngqí Huáyǔ kè yǒu qízhōngkǎo, wǒ yǒu yìdiǎnr jǐnzhāng, suǒyǐ měi tiān wǎnshang dōu dúshū, yě liànxí xiězì, xīwàng xià ge xīngqí de kǎoshì néng kǎo de hěn hǎo.","english":"I will have the midterm exam for Chinese class next week. I am a bit nervous so I study every night and practice writing Chinese characters as well. I hope I can do well on the exam next week.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個學期開始，從星期一到星期五我都有華語課，每天從上午八點四十分到中午十二點上課，下午一點寫功課，有時候也跟同學練習說中文。","pinyin":"Zhè ge xuéqí kāishǐ, cóng xīngqí yī dào xīngqí wǔ, wǒ dōu yǒu Huáyǔ kè, měi tiān cóng shàngwǔ bā diǎn sìshí fēn dào zhōngwǔ shí’èr diǎn shàngkè, xiàwǔ yī diǎn xiě gōngkè, yǒushíhou yě gēn tóngxué liànxí shuō Zhōngwén.","english":"This semester I have Chinese class from 8:40 a.m. to 12:00 noon, Mondays to Fridays. I start to do my homework at 1:00 p.m., and sometimes I practice speaking Chinese with my classmates.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L11-3-09\",\"照\",\"照\",\"照\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我去年去看了，很多大人帶著小孩去看燈會，非常熱鬧，我照了很多相片。","pinyin":"Wǒ qùnián qù kàn le, hěn duō dàrén dài zhe xiǎohái qù kàn dēnghuì, fēicháng rènào, wǒ zhào le hěn duō xiàngpiàn.","english":"Last year I went to see the Carnival. Many adults brought their children to see the Lantern Carnival, and it was very lively. I took a lot of photos.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 昭(bright) flash takes over 灬(fire) lamps → one perfect 照(photo)."},{"key":"[\"B2L01-1-11\",\"溫柔\",\"溫柔\",\"温柔\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"李先生的女朋友又溫柔又客氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-11","sourceFront":"溫柔","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"李先生的女朋友又溫柔又客氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-12","sourceFront":"客氣","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"一般人都喜歡跟性格溫柔、樂觀的人交朋友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-08","sourceFront":"性格","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"何小姐地個性溫柔，笑起來也很迷人，所以追求她的人很多。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-30","sourceFront":"迷人","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"石經理對員工很兇，回家後卻能表現出溫柔的一面，非常體貼太太。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-31","sourceFront":"面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老謝溫柔體貼、聰明英俊，符合我結婚對象的條件，因此我答應嫁給他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-42","sourceFront":"嫁","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:江先生對父母很孝順，個性又溫柔，將來一定是好先生。B:這還用說嗎？要是妳對他有意思，就得早點兒行動喔！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-60","sourceFront":"這還用說嗎？","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L01-2-01\",\"害羞\",\"害羞\",\"害羞\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"她很害羞，不敢跟不認識的人說話。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-2-01","sourceFront":"害羞","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他不敢約女生出去，或許是因為太害羞了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-03","sourceFront":"或許","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那對雙胞胎長得很像，個性卻很不同，哥哥很大方，弟弟很害羞。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-22","sourceFront":"卻","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你別看她一臉害羞的樣子，在熟人面前她可是很開朗的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-09","sourceFront":"熟人","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L10-1-20\",\"照\",\"照\",\"照\",\"Prep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我去年去看了，很多大人帶著小孩去看燈會，非常熱鬧，我照了很多相片。","pinyin":"Wǒ qùnián qù kàn le, hěn duō dàrén dài zhe xiǎohái qù kàn dēnghuì, fēicháng rènào, wǒ zhào le hěn duō xiàngpiàn.","english":"Last year I went to see the Carnival. Many adults brought their children to see the Lantern Carnival, and it was very lively. I took a lot of photos.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 昭(bright) flash takes over 灬(fire) lamps → one perfect 照(photo)."},{"key":"[\"B2L10-2-13\",\"繼續\",\"繼續\",\"继续\",\"Vaux/V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"今天上課上到這裡，明天再繼續吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-13","sourceFront":"繼續","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"健身教練說，等我病好了，體力好一點兒了，就應該繼續慢跑。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-13","sourceFront":"繼續","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"畢業後要工作還是要繼續念書，我得好好地想想再選擇！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-1-07","sourceFront":"選擇","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在我爺爺奶奶的年代，生活比較辛苦，不少窮人為了省錢，衣服破了還是繼續穿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-24","sourceFront":"破","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小白喝了太多酒，已經醉了，不能讓他繼續喝了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-11","sourceFront":"醉","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小連跟老闆吵架而離開了公司，為了讓家人能繼續過安定的生活，他正努力地找新工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-05","sourceFront":"安定","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"易先生從職場退休後，就加入了醫院的服務社團，繼續為社會貢獻一份力量。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-16","sourceFront":"職場","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"昨天棒球賽進行到一半時突然下起了大雨，雖然後來雨停了，但因為球場太溼，也無法繼續比賽了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-16","sourceFront":"進行","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"爬山時如果碰到大雨就應避免繼續前進，以免發生危險。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-20","sourceFront":"前進","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"碰到困難無法繼續前進時，暫時後退等待機會也是一種作法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-21","sourceFront":"後退","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"哎喲，已經半夜一點多了！我們就別再加班寫產品計畫了，等明天再繼續吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-31","sourceFront":"哎喲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"孩子：我玩電腦遊戲玩得正高興，你為什麼不讓我繼續玩？爸爸：得了！你玩到眼睛都紅了。去外面運動運動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-59","sourceFront":"得了","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-1-15\",\"保護\",\"保護\",\"保护\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"為了保護我們愛的人，我們得勇敢一點兒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-1-16","sourceFront":"勇敢","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"孔先生學法律，不但是為了當好律師，也是為了保護家人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-38","sourceFront":"律師","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"地震時要保護自己的安全，最重要的是避免頭部受傷","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-01","sourceFront":"地震","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"警察的工作主要是保護民眾，讓好人不被傷害。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-17","sourceFront":"傷害","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母不能保護孩子一輩子，得讓他們自己經驗一些挫折，才能培養出堅強的性格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-04","sourceFront":"堅強","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有一些網路上的資料或影片是被保護的，不能隨便下載。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-25","sourceFront":"下載","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"史教授為了讓更多人了解保護地球環境有多重要，經常到各地去演講。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-32","sourceFront":"演講","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"做好環境保護的工作，是每個現代人應盡的責任。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-08","sourceFront":"責任","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"使用地球資源和保護地球環境是相對的，資源使用得越多，環境就越需要被保護。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-28","sourceFront":"相對","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"政府最主要的任務應是維持並保護社會安全，其次是規畫各種制度，使國家穩定地成長。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-29","sourceFront":"政府","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大地就像我們的母親一樣，一直保護著我們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-57","sourceFront":"大地","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位母親寧可犧牲自己的生命，也要保護孩子的安全。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-10","sourceFront":"寧可","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從小時候起，他的第一志願就是當一位保護國家的軍人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-03","sourceFront":"志願","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他去當環保志工是為了保護自然環境，也是為了培養耐心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-01","sourceFront":"志工","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-2-11\",\"處理\",\"處理\",\"处理\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"護理師的工作就是幫助醫生處理病人的問題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-11","sourceFront":"處理","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他這次到美國去出差，幫公司處理了不少問題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-08","sourceFront":"出差","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:你怎麼了？看起來很不開心的樣子。 B:唉！工廠發生問題，今天又得加班處理了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-40","sourceFront":"唉","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:我太糊塗了，忘了把變更後的網路銀行密碼記下來。 B:這下子你得親自去銀行處理了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-26","sourceFront":"變更","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現在的電腦處理資料的速度比以往快得多，功能也更多了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-11","sourceFront":"以往","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"鄰居有急事得出門處理，請我暫時幫他照顧孩子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-21","sourceFront":"暫時","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"總統處理任何問題時，最先想到的應該是國家的利益，不是個人的利益。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-06","sourceFront":"利益","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天上午學校附近發生了車禍，經過警察處理後，現在交通已恢復正常。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-11","sourceFront":"已","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"像食物銀行、愛心冰箱此類處理食物的做法，不但可以節省資源，還能幫助需要的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-05","sourceFront":"此","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要是新買的商品有問題，七天以內可帶收據到店裡處理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-34","sourceFront":"收據","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"購物網站會把常見的購物問題及處理方式放在網頁上，提供給顧客參考。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-03","sourceFront":"常見","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在路上撿到錢包可以交給警察，請他們幫忙處理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-03","sourceFront":"撿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家超商食品賣不完就丟掉的作法，不但白白浪費食物，回收處理的成本也增加了，長期下來十分浪費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-26","sourceFront":"浪費","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在路邊的攤子享受小吃，得注意他們處理食物的方式衛不衛生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-28","sourceFront":"衛生","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想把菜園照顧好，平時就得多用心，看到蟲子就得處理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-54","sourceFront":"用心","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"病人受傷的地方如果沒有好好處理，很容易會被感染。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-11","sourceFront":"感染","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人都有煩惱，如果能好好處理，就能從過程中得到經驗。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-06","sourceFront":"煩惱","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果遇到無法處理的心理問題，最好請專業人員來輔導。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-02","sourceFront":"輔導","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在處理那位顧客的問題上，餐廳的態度真令我失望。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-30","sourceFront":"失望","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們公司的大型宴會活動，一向是宣傳部門負責處理的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-55","sourceFront":"宴會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"祕書趁老闆不在把商品計畫偷走，這事已經交給法院處理了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-31","sourceFront":"祕書","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雕刻玉器的技術很複雜，目前多半還是只能靠人工處理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-31","sourceFront":"雕刻","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"處理老房屋的問題，有時比重新建築一棟房子還要困難。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-37","sourceFront":"建築","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"電腦工程師除了維護電腦，還要處理各種與電腦相關的問題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-23","sourceFront":"維護","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們打算用擲銅錢的方式，來決定讓誰處理這件事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-04","sourceFront":"擲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"錯誤通常來自粗心，因此無論事情大小都該用心處理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-13","sourceFront":"來自","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L03-1-02\",\"吃虧\",\"吃虧\",\"吃亏\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小元昨天剛買了一件八千元的大衣，沒想到那家服裝店今天打三折，他太吃虧了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-02","sourceFront":"吃虧","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"你先別急著買，貨比三家不吃虧，多看幾家再決定吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-38","sourceFront":"貨比三家不吃虧","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我妹妹的個性太單純了，別人說什麼她都相信，難怪常吃虧","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-13","sourceFront":"單純","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"To 吃(eat) a 虧(loss): 吃虧 means suffer losses, to be taken advantage of."},{"key":"[\"B3L07-1-12\",\"數\",\"數\",\"数\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"記者說參加這次慢跑活動的人數已經超過了一百人，可是我數來數去只有五十幾個。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-12","sourceFront":"數","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"華人喜歡像二、六、八的數字，這幾個數字都是雙數，有很多好事一起來的意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-14","sourceFront":"雙數","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在古代，大多數的人思想很保守。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-21","sourceFront":"保守","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在古代，大多數的人思想很保守。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-20","sourceFront":"思想","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在古代，大多數的人思想很保守。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-19","sourceFront":"古代","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在中國，大多數南方人吃飯，北方人吃麵和水餃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-17","sourceFront":"北方","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在中國，大多數南方人吃飯，北方人吃麵和水餃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-16","sourceFront":"南方","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"在春節的前一天，大多數的華人都會回到父母家一起慶祝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-01","sourceFront":"春節","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"不管大人還是小孩，大多數的人都喜歡流行的東西。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-12","sourceFront":"不管","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這篇作文的錯字太多了，所以分數不高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-13","sourceFront":"錯字","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這次數學期末考的筆試很難，我有四題寫錯了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-28","sourceFront":"題","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這次考試很難，可是大家的分數都不低，好奇怪！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-21","sourceFront":"低","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這次考試的分數沒有我想的那麼差。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-20","sourceFront":"差","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"山本良介還在台灣學中文，他的中文課明年二月才結束。我今天有三個小時的數學課，剛剛才下課。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-26","sourceFront":"才","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:我覺得語言比數學有趣多了？ B:我同意你說的。","pinyin":"A: Wǒ juéde yǔyán bǐ shùxué yǒuqù duō le? B: Wǒ tóngyì nǐ shuō de.","english":"A: I think languages are much more interesting than math? B: I agree with what you said.","sourceCardId":"B1L14-2-20","sourceFront":"同意","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這幾個數學問題我都不懂，不知道怎麼算。","pinyin":"Zhè jǐ ge shùxué wèntí wǒ dōu bù dǒng, bù zhīdào zěnme suàn.","english":"I don't understand any of these math problems; I don't know how to calculate them.","sourceCardId":"B1L13-3-02","sourceFront":"數學","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"老師認為這個問題很難，只有一個學生回答得很正確，所以給他加了一些分數。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-21","sourceFront":"正確","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天的數學考試我只考了三十分，要是被爸爸知道，他一定會罵我的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-05","sourceFront":"罵","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次數學考試的題目似乎難了點，因為超過三分之二的學生考不及格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-02","sourceFront":"似乎","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下課以後，老師幫我一對一補習數學，希望我的期末考會及格","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-11","sourceFront":"對","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大多數的人認為哲學是一門很難的學問，不容易理解","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-11","sourceFront":"理解","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老師把學生每次考試的分數記錄下來，這樣就能知道學生是不是進步了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-03","sourceFront":"記錄","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"天上有無數個星星，聚在一起就變成了美麗的銀河。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-14","sourceFront":"無數","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家醫院昨天半夜發生嚴重的火災，受傷的人數約有三十名。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-21","sourceFront":"人數","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這班學生多數都會說法國話，其中有半數是從歐洲來的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-36","sourceFront":"半數","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對大多數人來說，沒有用的垃圾是廢物，有用的垃圾是資源。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-38","sourceFront":"廢物","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的同事遲到的次數太多了，這個月被扣了半個月的薪水。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-05","sourceFront":"次數","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我國四十歲以下的單身女性人數，比去年增加了百分之十。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-40","sourceFront":"女性","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一般來說，到舞廳跳舞的多數是年輕人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-13","sourceFront":"舞廳","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了發展個人事業而放下學業，多數人是很難做到的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-42","sourceFront":"學業","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大多數的模特兒都是腿長腰細的，穿什麼服裝都好看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-42","sourceFront":"細","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位新郎的歲數比新娘大十五歲，可是兩人看起來一樣年輕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-15","sourceFront":"歲數","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的親戚是數學教授，每次我有這方面的問題就向他請教。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-10","sourceFront":"親戚","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大多數投資專家都不敢保證在房屋市場一定能賺錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-03","sourceFront":"專家","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從政府宣布石油、電費雙漲的作法以來，反對的民眾人數已近七成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-46","sourceFront":"近","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"參加廚師比賽，只要味道部分的分數很高，就有機會得獎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-34","sourceFront":"得獎","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 婁(constellation) hears a 攵(tap) → the sky starts to 數(count)."},{"key":"[\"B3L10-1-19\",\"發出\",\"發出\",\"发出\",\"Vpt\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"公司向每位員工發出健檢通知，上面寫著檢查時間、地點和需要注意的事情","pinyin":"","engli