ookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"打仗期間，許多軍人為國家犧牲了寶貴的生命，也給家人留下了痛苦的記憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-14","sourceFront":"打仗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"剛學的詞和語法最好常使用、多複習，如此才能加深記憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-16","sourceFront":"加深","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人類大腦分成幾區，有的管語言，有的管記憶，很有意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-23","sourceFront":"大腦","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L15-1-11\",\"生動\",\"生動\",\"生动\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那位畫家的作品十分生動，畫裡的人物好像真的能從畫裡走出來一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-11","sourceFront":"生動","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這本書有豐富的內容及生動的鉛筆畫，是吸引讀者購買的主要原因。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-07","sourceFront":"及","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3}],"wordHook":"Combining 生(birth) and 動(move): 生動 means vivid."},{"key":"[\"B4L05-1-38\",\"废物\",\"廢物\",\"废物\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"對大多數人來說，沒有用的垃圾是廢物，有用的垃圾是資源。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-38","sourceFront":"廢物","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L06-2-04\",\"舞蹈\",\"舞蹈\",\"舞蹈\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"從那個偶像團體的舞蹈，就可以看出他們練(to practice)舞時花了多少工夫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-05","sourceFront":"舞","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我們吃完早餐，就動身去舞蹈教室練習舞蹈。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-19","sourceFront":"動身","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我新學的舞蹈很複雜，常忘了什麼時候前進或後退。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-13","sourceFront":"複雜","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們學校的啦啦隊隊員個子都很高，舞蹈的技巧也很出色。","pinyin"