rceFront":"地","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我今天本來想去看電影，後來下雨就沒去了。","pinyin":"Wǒ jīntiān běnlái xiǎng qù kàn diànyǐng, hòulái xià yǔ jiù méi qù le.","english":"Today I originally wanted to go see a movie, but later it rained so I didn't go.","sourceCardId":"B1L16-2-02","sourceFront":"後來","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-40\",\"赞成\",\"贊成\",\"赞成\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"她沒有針對此事發表看法，所以不知道她贊不贊成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-40","sourceFront":"贊成","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"父母反對她從事電影行業，哪怕收入很高，還是不贊成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-14","sourceFront":"反對","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-2-28\",\"人性\",\"人性\",\"人性\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"假如人人都發揮人性美好的一面，就能給社會帶來和平。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-28","sourceFront":"人性","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"下載\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Bringing files down 下(below) to 載(load) onto your personal device: 下載 means download."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"佛教\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 佛(Buddha) and 教(education): 佛教 means Buddhism."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"塌\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A mound of loose 土(soil) bakes under the 日(sun) until crumbling like light 羽(feather) dust, causing the wall to 塌(collapse)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"桌\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a ⺊(divination crack) rests on 日(sun) and 朩(split wood) legs → the sturdy 桌(table)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"歌\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"an 哥(elder brother) calls out, 欠(lack) of breath and all → a whole 歌(song)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"牌\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 片(slice) of cardboard leans on a 卑(humble) chair → a 牌(card)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"界\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 田(field) meets an 介(agent) at the fence line → 界(boundary)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"練習\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"練(drill) + 習(study) → drill and study = to practice."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"行\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 彳(step) takes a 亍(small step) beside → off we 行(go) now."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"褲子\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"褲(pants) + 子(noun suffix): a pair of pants → 子 just makes it a noun."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"陌\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Standing in a 阝(place) where 百(one hundred) strangers pass, you feel out of place; that feeling is 陌(strange)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"題\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Ask what something 是(is) on each exam 頁(page) → the 題(question)."}]}
